WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.534
-Welcome back, everybody.
We're hanging out with Simu Liu.

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:06.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.100
Simu, the Internet has been
having fun with the --

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.000
they're obsessed with,
a lot of people like early gigs

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.400
and stuff, early jobs.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.934
They're having a lot of fun this
week because you used to be

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:17.200
a model for stock photos.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.167
-Yeah, not the,
not the nice kind.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:21.934
Not the runway model, like,
international, you know,

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:24.734
colognes and stuff, no,
a stock model.

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.834
-So, can you explain what a
stock photo is?

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:28.434
-Yeah, yeah.
I mean so, you know,

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:31.167
if you're, like, a nice model,
you get paid

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:33.667
thousands of dollars,
you walk the runway,

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:36.200
lots of international prestige
and all that stuff.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.400
If you're a stock model,
you get paid typically, like,

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.100
a base rate, so for me, I did a
one-day shoot, one-day shoot

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.634
for 100 bucks.
-Wow.

00:00:44.634 --> 00:00:47.734
-And they own the rights tot he
photos that they take,

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:50.367
in perpetuity,
which is very, very important

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:52.334
and it means that the rights
never run out,

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:55.667
which means that they could sell
these photos and make

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:58.834
millions and millions of dollars
off of them

00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:01.634
and the talent
would not see a penny.

00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:03.167
-No.
-So that's what happened to me.

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:05.133
-I'd like to show a couple of
these photos if you don't mind.

00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:07.234
-Please don't.
-I have to because

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:08.767
they're great.
Here's you --

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:11.200
It's a stock photo of,
I guess it's just a man

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.334
pointing at a laptop.
-Yep.

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:16.367
[ Laughter ]
The numbers came in, Jimmy.

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:17.534
-Yeah, the numbers came in,
they were up.

00:01:17.534 --> 00:01:19.367
-They're lookin' good.
We're in the green.

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:21.334
[ Laughter ]
-This one I love.

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:24.534
This is I don't know what is
this like a class?

00:01:24.534 --> 00:01:29.434
-Okay, this is.
[ Laughter ]

