-[ Laughs ]

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.367
-This is a Zumba class.
-Okay.

00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:36.133
-This is Zumba.
-You never know when you might

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:39.167
