-Just me, Jimmy.

00:01:49.601 --> 00:01:50.934
-Just you.
-Just me.

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:52.400
You're taking care of yourself.
Well, then the Internet,

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:56.400
